#. 誰でも勝ちたいとは思うが、
#. 勝つ為に頑張れるヤツは少ない…
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"\"The key is not the 'will to win.' Everybody has that.\n"
"It's the will to *prepare* to win that's important.\""
msgstr ""

#. バスケットボール選手の
#. ボビー・ナイトの言葉だよ。
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That's a quote from the famous basketball coach Bobby\n"
"Knight!"
msgstr ""

#. なんて言うか…本気で頑張らないとね！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So it's like...we have to work hard, ya know!?"
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Hina"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうしよう？
#. 朝日奈さんを誘ってみようか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I talk to Hina for a while?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これから２階のプールで、
#. 軽く泳ごうと思ってたんだけど…
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I was thinking of going to the pool for a quick dip."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあさ、苗木も一緒に行こうよ！
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You should come with me!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんと一緒に、
#. プールで軽く泳いだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I went for a swim with Hina...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Hina a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
